{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-fountainhead-of-western-thought","title":"西方思想的源头","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-fountainhead-of-western-thought","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章对柏拉图作出综合评价。&quot;西方思想的源头&quot;，是对柏拉图崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他是哲学体系的奠基者、思想传统的开创者、伟大师承谱系的源头。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其卓越贡献与崇高地位，又客观正视围绕他的种种探讨与争议，以辩证的眼光，认识这位永恒的思想巨人。</p>\n"}